------------------------------------------------------------------------------
LOYAL CUSTOMERS 
  1,522 customers (35.1%) | 18.2% of revenue
  Median R/F/M: 28 days | 6 orders | 1,531
  Priority : Growth 
  Channel  : Email + retargeting 
  Strategy : Volume discounts and bundle offers to raise average order value; cross-sell adjacent categories. 

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
POTENTIAL / OCCASIONAL 
  1,483 customers (34.2%) | 4.3% of revenue
  Median R/F/M: 81 days | 3 orders | 370
